          <div>
            <h3 data-key="process.analysis.title">Analyse.</h3>
            <p data-key="process.analysis.text">Ich sehe mir Anwendung, Tests und Abläufe an und schlage einen konkreten Plan vor.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
          <div>
            <h3 data-key="process.build.title">Umsetzung.</h3>
            <p data-key="process.build.text">Ich setze den Plan mit Ihrem Team um, in kleinen Schritten, die Sie jederzeit sehen.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
          <div>
            <h3 data-key="process.handover.title">Übergabe.</h3>
            <p data-key="process.handover.text">Ich dokumentiere das Setup und arbeite Ihr Team ein, damit es ohne mich weitergeht.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ======== PROJECTS ======== -->
  <section id="projects" class="py-24 md:py-36 px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="reveal">
        <h2 class="section-title" data-key="projects.title">Projekte</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-text-main/75 mb-12 md:mb-16 max-w-xl" data-key="projects.sub">Zoll, Handel, Banken und ein Bauunternehmen.</p>
      </div>

      <ol class="timeline">
        {projects.map((project) => (
          <li id={project.id} class="timeline-item scroll-mt-28">
            <div class="timeline-when">
              <p class="timeline-year">{yearSpan(project.periodDe)}</p>
              <p class="timeline-period">
                <span data-show-lang="de">{project.periodDe}</span>
                <span data-show-lang="en" class="hidden">{project.periodEn}</span>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-body">
              <p class="timeline-industry">
                <span data-show-lang="de">{project.industryDe}</span>
                <span data-show-lang="en" class="hidden">{project.industryEn}</span>
              </p>
              <h3 class="timeline-company">
                <span data-show-lang="de">{project.companyDe}</span>
                <span data-show-lang="en" class="hidden">{project.companyEn}</span>
              </h3>
              <p class="timeline-text">
                <span data-show-lang="de">{project.textDe}</span>
                <span data-show-lang="en" class="hidden">{project.textEn}</span>
              </p>
              <p class="timeline-tools">
                <span data-show-lang="de">{project.tagsDe.join(' · ')}</span>
                <span data-show-lang="en" class="hidden">{project.tagsEn.join(' · ')}</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ======== TECH STACK ======== -->
  <section id="stack" class="py-24 md:py-36 px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="reveal">
        <h2 class="section-title" data-key="stack.title">Tech Stack</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-text-main/75 mb-8 max-w-xl" data-key="stack.sub">Womit ich arbeite.</p>
        <p class="stack-line">{techStack.join(' · ')}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ======== ABOUT ======== -->
  <section id="about" class="py-24 md:py-36 px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="section-title reveal" data-key="about.title">Über mich</h2>
      <div class="about-layout">
        <div class="about-copy reveal">
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-8 md:leading-9" data-key="about.para1">
            Eigentlich wollte ich Entwickler werden. In die IT bin ich über meine erste QA-Rolle gekommen und dabei geblieben, weil ich Software gern bis ins Detail anschaue. Den Code schreibe ich heute in der Testautomatisierung.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-8 md:leading-9" data-key="about.para2">
            Ich höre nicht auf, bevor klar ist, warum etwas fehlschlägt. Danach soll das Team wissen, was zu tun ist, ohne dass ich noch eine Runde erklären muss.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-8 md:leading-9" data-key="about.para3">
            Seit 2019 teste ich in Banken, im Handel und im öffentlichen Sektor. Aktuell arbeite ich beim BRZ an der Zollanwendung Customs Decision Austria. Ich arbeite remote und vor Ort.
          </p>
          <div class="about-certs-block">
            <p class="about-kicker" data-key="about.certs">Zertifikate</p>
            <ul class="about-certs">
              <li data-key="about.cert1">ISTQB Certified Tester Foundation Level (April 2019)</li>
              <li data-key="about.cert2">ISTQB Advanced Level Test Analyst (Dezember 2024)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <p class="text-lg leading-8" data-key="about.network">
            Bei größeren Projekten stelle ich ein Team aus erfahrenen QA-Freelancern aus meinem Netzwerk zusammen.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="photo-slot reveal">
          <Image
            src={portrait}
            alt="Porträt von Mario Lirsch"
            data-alt-key="about.portraitAlt"
            width={640}
            widths={[400, 640, 880]}
            sizes="(min-width: 768px) 20rem, min(17.5rem, 78vw)"
            quality={80}
            format="webp"
            class="photo-slot-img"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ======== CONTACT ======== -->
  <section id="contact" class="py-24 md:py-36 px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="reveal max-w-xl">
        <h2 class="section-title" data-key="contact.title">Kontakt</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-text-main/75 mb-12 leading-relaxed" data-key="contact.sub">Schreiben Sie mir kurz, worum es geht. Ich melde mich bei Ihnen.</p>
      </div>

      <form
        id="contact-form"
        action="/api/contact"
        method="post"
        accept-charset="utf-8"
        class="contact-form reveal"
      >
        <div class="contact-field">
          <label for="contact-name" data-key="contact.name">Name</label>
          <input id="contact-name" type="text" name="name" class="form-input" autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" placeholder="Ihr Name" required data-placeholder-de="Ihr Name" data-placeholder-en="Your name" />
        </div>
        <div class="contact-field">
          <label for="contact-email" data-key="contact.email">E-Mail</label>
          <input id="contact-email" type="email" name="email" class="form-input" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" placeholder="max@example.com" required />
        </div>
        <div class="contact-field">
          <label for="contact-topic" data-key="contact.topic">Worum geht es?</label>
          <select id="contact-topic" name="topic" class="form-input" required>
            <option value="" data-key="contact.topicPlaceholder">Bitte wählen</option>
            <option value="strategy" data-key="contact.topicStrategy">Teststrategie</option>
            <option value="automation" data-key="contact.topicAutomation">Testautomatisierung</option>
            <option value="team" data-key="contact.topicTeam">Unterstützung im Team</option>
            <option value="other" data-key="contact.topicOther">Sonstiges</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-field">
          <label for="contact-message" data-key="contact.message">Nachricht</label>
          <textarea id="contact-message" name="message" rows="6" class="form-input resize-none" maxlength="5000" placeholder="Ein paar Sätze reichen." required data-placeholder-de="Ein paar Sätze reichen." data-placeholder-en="A few sentences are enough."></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-hp" aria-hidden="true">
          <label for="contact-hp">Company</label>
          <input id="contact-hp" type="text" name="hp_field" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
        </div>
        <div class="contact-consent">
          <input id="contact-consent" type="checkbox" name="consent" value="yes" required />
          <label for="contact-consent">
            <span data-show-lang="de">Ich habe die <a href="/privacy">Datenschutzerklärung</a> gelesen und bin einverstanden, dass Name, E-Mail und Nachricht zur Beantwortung verwendet werden.</span>
            <span data-show-lang="en" class="hidden">I have read the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> and agree that my name, email, and message may be used to reply.</span>
          </label>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-actions">
          <button type="submit" class="btn-cta" data-key="contact.send">Nachricht senden</button>
          <p id="contact-status" class="contact-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1" hidden></p>
          <p class="contact-note" data-key="contact.note">Die Nachricht geht an mich. Es öffnet sich kein E-Mail-Programm.</p>
        </div>
      </form>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start gap-6 mt-14 reveal">
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mario-lirsch"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="flex items-center gap-3 text-text-main/70 hover:text-text-main transition-colors"
        >
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
            <path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 01-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 112.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="text-sm" data-key="contact.linkedin">LinkedIn-Profil</span>
        </a>

        <a
          href="mailto:mario@lqa-consulting.com"
          class="flex items-center gap-3 text-text-main/70 hover:text-text-main transition-colors"
        >
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/>
            <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="text-sm" data-key="contact.emaillink">E-Mail schreiben</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ======== FOOTER ======== -->
  <footer class="border-t border-white/[0.06] py-12 px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-5 md:gap-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-xs text-text-main/35 tracking-wide">© {year} Mario Lirsch · <span data-show-lang="de">IT-Dienstleister</span><span data-show-lang="en" class="hidden">IT Service Provider</span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 md:gap-6">
        <!-- Talent Network temporarily disabled — see notice in nav above
        <a href="/talent" class="text-sm text-green-accent/60 hover:text-green-accent transition-colors">Talent Network</a>
        -->
        <a href="/legal" class="text-sm text-text-main/30 hover:text-text-main/60 transition-colors" data-key="footer.legal">Impressum</a>
        <a href="/privacy" class="text-sm text-text-main/30 hover:text-text-main/60 transition-colors" data-key="footer.privacy">Datenschutz</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>

<!-- ======== SCRIPTS ======== -->
<script define:vars={{ tDE: t.de, tEN: t.en }}>
  // ---- Translations ----
  const translations = { de: tDE, en: tEN };
  let currentLang = 'de';

  function getNestedValue(obj, key) {
    return key.split('.').reduce((o, k) => (o ? o[k] : undefined), obj);
  }

  function applyTranslations(lang) {
    const t = translations[lang];
    currentLang = lang;

    // Update html lang attr
    document.documentElement.lang = lang;

    // Text nodes
    document.querySelectorAll('[data-key]').forEach(el => {
      const val = getNestedValue(t, el.dataset.key);
      if (val) el.textContent = val;
    });

    document.querySelectorAll('[data-alt-key]').forEach(el => {
      const val = getNestedValue(t, el.dataset.altKey);
      if (val) el.alt = val;
    });

    // Placeholder text
    document.querySelectorAll('[data-placeholder-de]').forEach(el => {
      el.placeholder = el.dataset[`placeholder${lang.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + lang.slice(1)}`] || el.dataset.placeholderDe;
    });

    // Show/hide language-specific content (data-show-lang)
    document.querySelectorAll('[data-show-lang]').forEach(el => {
      el.classList.toggle('hidden', el.dataset.showLang !== lang);
    });

    // Update lang buttons
    document.querySelectorAll('#btn-de, #btn-de-m').forEach(b => b.classList.toggle('active', lang === 'de'));
    document.querySelectorAll('#btn-en, #btn-en-m').forEach(b => b.classList.toggle('active', lang === 'en'));

    renderContactStatus();

    // Update meta
    const metaDesc = document.querySelector('meta[name="description"]');
    if (lang === 'en' && metaDesc) {
      metaDesc.content = 'Test strategy, test automation, and hands-on QA for companies, from the first analysis to a setup that runs. Mario Lirsch, QA engineer in Vienna.';
      document.title = 'LQA Consulting – Test strategy and test automation | Mario Lirsch';
    } else if (metaDesc) {
      metaDesc.content = 'Teststrategie, Testautomatisierung und QA im Team für Unternehmen. Von der Analyse bis zum laufenden Setup. Mario Lirsch, QA-Engineer in Wien.';
      document.title = 'LQA Consulting – Teststrategie und Testautomatisierung | Mario Lirsch';
    }
  }

  window.setLang = function(lang) {
    applyTranslations(lang);
    try { localStorage.setItem('lqa-lang', lang); } catch(e) {}
  };

  // ---- Nav scroll effect ----
  const nav = document.getElementById('nav');
  window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
    nav.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 40);
  }, { passive: true });

  // ---- Mobile menu ----
  const menuBtn = document.getElementById('menu-btn');
  const mobileMenu = document.getElementById('mobile-menu');
  menuBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    mobileMenu.classList.toggle('hidden');
  });
  window.closeMobileMenu = function() {
    mobileMenu.classList.add('hidden');
  };

  // ---- Scroll reveal (individual elements + stagger parents) ----
  const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
    entries.forEach(entry => {
      if (entry.isIntersecting) {
        entry.target.classList.add('visible');
        observer.unobserve(entry.target);
      }
    });
  }, { threshold: 0.08, rootMargin: '0px 0px -40px 0px' });

  document.querySelectorAll('.reveal, .reveal-stagger').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));

  // ---- ScrollSpy — highlight active nav link ----
  const spySections = ['services', 'process', 'projects', 'about', 'contact'];
  const navLinks = document.querySelectorAll('.nav-link');
  function updateActiveNav() {
    const scrollY = window.scrollY + 120;
    let current = '';
    for (const id of spySections) {
      const el = document.getElementById(id);
      if (el && scrollY >= el.offsetTop) current = id;
    }
    navLinks.forEach(link => {
      const href = link.getAttribute('href');
      const isActive = href === `#${current}`;
      link.classList.toggle('active', isActive);
    });
  }
  window.addEventListener('scroll', updateActiveNav, { passive: true });

  // ---- Contact form ----
  function renderContactStatus() {
    const el = document.getElementById('contact-status');
    if (!el) return;
    const key = el.dataset.status;
    if (!key) {
      el.hidden = true;
      el.textContent = '';
      el.classList.remove('is-error', 'is-success');
      return;
    }
    el.hidden = false;
    el.textContent = getNestedValue(translations[currentLang], 'contact.' + key) || '';
    el.classList.toggle('is-error', key === 'failed' || key === 'invalid');
    el.classList.toggle('is-success', key === 'sent');
  }

  const contactForm = document.getElementById('contact-form');
  if (contactForm) {
    contactForm.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      const status = document.getElementById('contact-status');
      const button = contactForm.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
      if (!status || !button || button.disabled) return;
      if (!contactForm.reportValidity()) return;

      button.disabled = true;
      contactForm.setAttribute('aria-busy', 'true');
      status.dataset.status = 'sending';
      renderContactStatus();

      const body = {
        name: contactForm.elements.name.value,
        email: contactForm.elements.email.value,
        topic: contactForm.elements.topic.value,
        message: contactForm.elements.message.value,
        consent: contactForm.elements.consent.checked,
        hp_field: contactForm.elements.hp_field.value,
      };

      try {
        const response = await fetch('/api/contact', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: {
            'content-type': 'application/json',
            accept: 'application/json',
          },
          body: JSON.stringify(body),
        });
        let payload = null;
        try { payload = await response.json(); } catch (e) {}
        if (response.ok && payload && payload.ok === true) {
          status.dataset.status = 'sent';
          contactForm.reset();
        } else if (payload && payload.error === 'validation') {
          status.dataset.status = 'invalid';
        } else {
          status.dataset.status = 'failed';
        }
      } catch (e) {
        status.dataset.status = 'failed';
      } finally {
        button.disabled = false;
        contactForm.removeAttribute('aria-busy');
        renderContactStatus();
        if (status.dataset.status === 'sent' || status.dataset.status === 'failed' || status.dataset.status === 'invalid') {
          status.focus();
        }
      }
    });
  }

  // ---- Init language ----
  (function init() {
    let lang = 'de';
    try { lang = localStorage.getItem('lqa-lang') || 'de'; } catch(e) {}
    if (lang !== 'de') applyTranslations(lang);

    const params = new URLSearchParams(location.search);
    const contactState = params.get('contact');
    if (contactState === 'sent' || contactState === 'failed' || contactState === 'invalid') {
      const status = document.getElementById('contact-status');
      if (status) status.dataset.status = contactState;
      renderContactStatus();
      const section = document.getElementById('contact');
      if (section) section.scrollIntoView();
      params.delete('contact');
      const next = params.toString();
      history.replaceState(null, '', location.pathname + (next ? '?' + next : '') + '#contact');
    }
  })();
</script>

</html>
